<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>GC Sign in for department and agencies partners</title>

    <!-- Utility framework -->
    <link rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://cdn.design-system.alpha.canada.ca/@cdssnc/gcds-utility@1.5.0/dist/gcds-utility.min.css" />

    <!-- <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/prism.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/style.css">
    <script src="/scripts/code-showcase.js"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/general.js"></script>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" sizes="96x96" href="/favicon.ico"> -->

    <!-- GC Design System  Components-->
    <link
        rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://cdn.design-system.alpha.canada.ca/@cdssnc/gcds-components@0.41.0/dist/gcds/gcds.css" />
    <script
        type="module"
        src="https://cdn.design-system.alpha.canada.ca/@cdssnc/gcds-components@0.41.0/dist/gcds/gcds.esm.js">    
    </script>

    <!-- Icons Font Awesome (to access icons, import Font Awesome) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.2/css/all.min.css"
    crossorigin="anonymous">

    <!-- Pagefind
    <script src="/pagefind/pagefind.js" type="module"></script>
    <script src="/scripts/search.js" type="module"></script> -->

  </head>
  <body>

    <gcds-header lang="en" skip-to-href="#mc" lang-href='https://connexion.alpha.canada.ca/'>  
        <gcds-top-nav slot="menu" label="Main menu" alignment="right">
            <gcds-nav-link slot="home" href="/">GC Sign in</gcds-nav-link>
    
            <gcds-nav-link href="/users/">
            Individuals and organisations
            </gcds-nav-link>
        
            <gcds-nav-link href="/partners/">
            Departments and agencies
            </gcds-nav-link>
        
        </gcds-top-nav>  

        <gcds-breadcrumbs lang="en" slot="breadcrumb">
            
        </gcds-breadcrumbs>
  
        <gcds-search search-id="search" slot="search" placeholder="GC Sign in" action="/en/search">
        </gcds-search>
    </gcds-header>

    <div class="content-wrapper">

      <main id="mc" class="general-layout">

        <section>
            <div class="md:py-1250 py-900 hero">
              <div class="container-xl mx-auto">
                <article class="sm:py-750 py-450 xl:ps-0 sm:ps-600 ps-450 sm:pe-750 pe-300 bg-primary text-light hero__content">
                  <h1>
                    <span class="d-block">Welcome to GC Sign in</span>
                  </h1>
                  <h1>Welcome to GC Sign in</h1>
                  <p>Accessing Government of Canada programs and services is now easier than ever. Use a single, secure sign-in to access all participating federal programs and services</p>
                  <!-- <a class="link-light" href="/en/about-us">About us</a> -->
                </article>
              </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="container-xl mx-auto xl:px-0 sm:px-600 px-225">

            <gcds-heading tag="h1" character-limit="false" margin-bottom="300">
                What is GC Sign in
            </gcds-heading>



<section>
    <gcds-grid tag="ul" columns-desktop="1fr 1fr 1fr" columns-tablet="1fr 1fr 1fr" columns="1fr">
        <li class="list-none">
        <!-- <img class="mb-150" src="../../images/common/home/icon-components.svg" alt=""> -->
        <p><i class="fa-solid fa-people-group fa-4x"></i></p>
        <h3 class="mt-0">Simplified sign-in</h3>
        <p>Provide users with a simple and secure doorway to your service, that includes the latest security standards</p>
        </li>
        <li class="list-none">
        <!-- <img class="mb-150" src="../../images/common/home/icon-components.svg" alt=""> -->
        <p><i class="fa-brands fa-canadian-maple-leaf fa-4x"></i></p>
        <h3 class="mt-0">Enhanced security through MFA</h3>
        <p>Users can sign in using assurance Level 2 authentication, supported through SMS or voice verification</p>    
        </li>
        <li class="list-none">
        <!-- <img class="mb-150" src="../../images/common/home/icon-components.svg" alt=""> -->
        <p><i class="fa-brands fa-canadian-maple-leaf fa-4x"></i></p>
        <h3 class="mt-0">Continuous evolution</h3>
        <p>GC Sign in will evolve over time (through CDS’s product management approach), as threats, user needs, and departmental needs evolve.</p>    
        </li>
    </gcds-grid>
    <gcds-button value="Learn more">
    Learn more &gt;
  </gcds-button>
</section>

<!-- <section>
  <gcds-button value="Learn more">
    Learn more &gt;
  </gcds-button>
</section> -->


<!-- <section>
  <gcds-heading tag="h1" character-limit="false">GC Sign in for federal department partners</gcds-heading>
  <gcds-text>
    <strong>GC Sign in provides a secure and easy way to access Government of Canada programs and services online.</strong>
  </gcds-text>
</section> -->

<section>
  <gcds-heading tag="h2">GC Sign in is set to become the single sign in solution for all Government of Canada services</gcds-heading>
  <gcds-text>
    Designed with users in mind, it offers a more intuitive, inclusive experience that makes accessing government programs easier than ever. For service providers, GC Sign in streamlines adoption and reduces overhead by eliminating the need for custom authentication systems. This centralized approach supports a more efficient, secure, and scalable digital ecosystem across departments.
  </gcds-text>

  <gcds-text>
    Want to see what’s next? Explore the GC Sign in Roadmap to learn about upcoming features and milestones.
  </gcds-text>
  <gcds-button value="GC Sign in Roadmap">
    GC Sign in Roadmap &gt;
  </gcds-button>
</section>







<section>
  <gcds-button value="Get Started">
    Get Started &gt;
  </gcds-button>
</section>

<section>
  <gcds-heading tag="h2">GC Sign in will help protect user accounts in several ways.</gcds-heading>
  <gcds-error-message message-id="message-props">
    Bulletted list below not showing. Look into it.
  </gcds-error-message>
 
  <gcds-text>
    <ul>
      <li>First, it will provide guidance to users on how to create more secure sign ins (e.g., strong passphrases, passkeys over passwords).</li>
      <li>Second, GC Sign in (and the SaaS it's built on) will be continually updated to address the evolving security landscape.</li>
      <li>Third, GC Sign in will eventually use telemetry and risk-based authentication to provide additional security.</li>
    </ul>
  </gcds-text>

  <gcds-text>
    Finally, GC Sign in will have monitoring and notification abilities to detect and alert to suspicious activity.
  </gcds-text>
</section>

  <!-- <ul>
      <li>First, it will provide guidance to users on how to create more secure sign ins (e.g., strong passphrases, passkeys over passwords).</li>
      <li>Second, GC Sign in (and the SaaS it's built on) will be continually updated to address the evolving security landscape.</li>
      <li>Third, GC Sign in will eventually use telemetry and risk-based authentication to provide additional security.</li>
  </ul> -->

<section>
  <gcds-heading tag="h2">See it in action</gcds-heading>

  <gcds-error-message message-id="message-props">
    DEMO VIDEO PREVIEW PLACEHOLDER
  </gcds-error-message>

  <gcds-text>
    See GC Sign in in action and discover how it simplifies secure access to government services.  Click to explore the user experience and key features in our video walkthrough.
  </gcds-text>
</section>

<section>
  <gcds-heading tag="h2">GC Sign in is set to become the single sign in solution for all Government of Canada services.</gcds-heading>

  <gcds-text>
    Designed with users in mind, it offers a more intuitive, inclusive experience that makes accessing government programs easier than ever. For service providers, GC Sign in streamlines adoption and reduces overhead by eliminating the need for custom authentication systems. This centralized approach supports a more efficient, secure, and scalable digital ecosystem across departments.
  </gcds-text>

  <gcds-text>
    Want to see what’s next? Explore the GC Sign in Roadmap to learn about upcoming features and milestones.
  </gcds-text>
</section>

<section>
  <gcds-button button-role="secondary" value="GC Sign in Roadmap">
    GC Sign in Roadmap
  </gcds-button>

  <gcds-text>
    &nbsp;
  </gcds-text>
</section>

        </main>

        <gcds-footer display="compact" lang="en"
            sub-links='{ "About GC Sign in": "/en/",
            "Help": "",
            "Terms": "/en/terms/" }'>
        </gcds-footer>

    </div>

    <script>
        function showTooltip(o,e){o.trigger.className.includes("tooltipped")||(o.trigger.children[0].className="tooltipped tooltipped-s",o.trigger.children[0].ariaLabel=e)}window.addEventListener("load",()=>{var o=new ClipboardJS(".code-copy");o.on("success",o=>showTooltip(o,"Copied!")),o.on("error",o=>showTooltip(o,"Failed..."))});
    </script>
    <script async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/clipboard@2.0.11/dist/clipboard.min.js">
    </script>
  
    </body>
</html>